-- חוזר לבעלויות תשפ"ה/5 (10.10.2024): הסכם קיבוצי עם ארגון המורים העל יסודיים מיום 23.09.2024
-- The main points of the collective agreement of 23.9.2024 between the
-- local-government employers and the secondary teachers' organization for
-- the upper divisions: a one-time grant for תשפ"ד, the Oz 2023 shekel
-- supplement in four pulses, the 38-hour work week, role rewards, the
-- school role reward, principals' supplements, the supplement for
-- employees outside the reform, special contracts, the retirement grant,
-- and the return of the strike days of September 2024.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common

-- Time in the regulative rules is counted in school months of תשפ"ה
-- (common.l4: September 2024 = 1, October 2024 = 2, November 2024 = 3,
-- January 2025 = 5, April 2025 = 8), unless a rule says otherwise.

§ `תשפ"ה/5 הסכם קיבוצי 23.09.2024`

-- akn:preamble/p1 akn:preamble/p2 akn:preamble/p3 akn:preamble/p4 akn:preamble/p5 akn:preamble/p6 akn:preamble/p7 akn:preamble/p8 akn:preamble/p9 akn:preamble/p10 akn:preamble/p11 akn:preamble/p12 The letterhead, date (10.10.2024), reference number, circular number, addressee (the owners of the upper divisions), greeting and subject line; no rule.

-- akn:preamble/p13 akn:preamble/p14 Background: the agreement was signed on 23.9.2024 between the local-government centre, the three large cities and the regional centre and the secondary teachers' organization, and approved by the Treasury's wages commissioner; the circular sets out its main points.

GIVEN d IS A DATE, e IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE d `is on or after` e IF
    DATE_SERIAL d AT LEAST DATE_SERIAL e

@desc How a pay component counts for the purposes the agreement names (true = it counts).
DECLARE `component treatment` HAS
    `is salary for every purpose`                IS A BOOLEAN
    `counts for the hourly value`                IS A BOOLEAN
    `counts for an hour's absence`               IS A BOOLEAN
    `counts for severance pay`                   IS A BOOLEAN
    `counts for pension contributions`           IS A BOOLEAN
    `counts for study-fund and Dafna contributions` IS A BOOLEAN
    `counts for the minimum-wage top-up`         IS A BOOLEAN
    `is in the base of other supplements`        IS A BOOLEAN
    `counts for the jubilee grant`               IS A BOOLEAN

DECLARE `agreement action` IS ONE OF
    `pay the one-time grant` HAS `grant paid` IS A NUMBER
    `deduct the rest of the advance` HAS `advance deducted` IS A NUMBER
    `pay the arrears` HAS `arrears paid` IS A NUMBER
    `set the rules of the integration-class reward`
    `pay the physiotherapists' clothing allowance` HAS `clothing paid` IS A NUMBER
    `report the special contracts to the teachers' organization`
    `pay the retirement grant` HAS `retirement grant paid` IS A NUMBER
    `pay the school-achievement grant` HAS `achievement grant paid` IS A NUMBER
    `apply for the school-achievement grant`
    `deduct an uncompleted strike advance` HAS `strike advance deducted` IS A NUMBER
    `reduce the salary for the unpaid strike days` HAS `strike reduction` IS A NUMBER
    `announce the end of the organizational measures`
    `publish the school roles and their units`
    `define each school role's main tasks`
    `publish the names appointed to school roles`
    `instruct the staff to report grades, issue certificates and join out-of-school activities`

@desc A row of 7(ב)'s table: from a date, the four pulses of the Oz 2023 shekel supplement for a full position and their total.
DECLARE `pulse row` HAS
    `pulses from`  IS A DATE
    `pulse 1`      IS A NUMBER
    `pulse 2`      IS A NUMBER
    `pulse 3`      IS A NUMBER
    `pulse 4`      IS A NUMBER
    `pulse total`  IS A NUMBER

DECLARE `degree` IS ONE OF `no degree`, `first degree`, `second degree or higher`

DECLARE `days band` HAS
    `hours from`  IS A NUMBER
    `hours to`    IS A NUMBER
    `days a week` IS A NUMBER


§§ `פרק א' כללי`

-- akn:art_1__para_a The preamble and annexes are part of the agreement; an interpretive clause with no case of its own.
-- akn:art_1__para_b Words in one gender include the other; an interpretive clause, so the encoding carries no sex.
-- akn:art_1__para_c Headings are for convenience and not used to interpret the agreement; an interpretive clause.
-- akn:art_1__para_d Mentioning letters, circulars or procedures does not change their normative standing; an interpretive clause.

-- §2 and §4: the agreement applies to every employee graded as teaching
-- staff whom the teachers' organization represents and the Oz LaTmura
-- agreement (of 14.8.2011, as amended) covers, in the reform or not. "In
-- the reform" means teachers and principals employed under its terms.
@desc A teaching employee as the agreement of 23.9.2024 sees one.
DECLARE `upper-division employee` HAS
    `represented by the teachers' organization`   IS A BOOLEAN
    `covered by the Oz LaTmura agreement`          IS A BOOLEAN
    `employed under Oz LaTmura terms`              IS A BOOLEAN
    `is a principal`                               IS A BOOLEAN

@ref akn:art_2/p1 akn:art_4/p1
GIVEN e IS AN `upper-division employee`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the agreement applies to` e IF
    e's `represented by the teachers' organization` AND e's `covered by the Oz LaTmura agreement`

@ref akn:art_4/p2 akn:art_4/p3 akn:art_4/p4
GIVEN e IS AN `upper-division employee`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `is in the reform` e IF
    `the agreement applies to` e AND e's `employed under Oz LaTmura terms`

GIVEN e IS AN `upper-division employee`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `is a teacher in the reform` e IF
    `is in the reform` e AND NOT e's `is a principal`

@ref akn:art_3/p1
`the agreement runs until` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 31 8 2028

§§ `5 מענק חד-פעמי בגין שנת הלימודים תשפ"ד`

DECLARE `grant month status` IS ONE OF
    `worked`
    `unpaid leave or sabbatical`
    `reserve duty`
    `birth and parenting period`
    `unpaid absence after the birth and parenting period`
    `not employed`

@desc One month of the grant period, 1.9.2023-30.8.2024, as section 5 asks about it.
DECLARE `grant month` HAS
    `status of the month`     IS A `grant month status`
    `position of the month`   IS A NUMBER  @desc the position held that month (above 1 where it exceeds 100%), or, for reserve duty or birth and parenting, the position held on the eve of leaving (5(ו))

-- 5(ה)-(ו): unpaid leave (sabbatical included) and leave treated as such
-- do not count, nor an unpaid absence after the birth-and-parenting
-- period; reserve duty and that period do, at the position held before.
@ref akn:art_5__para_e akn:art_5__para_e/p2 akn:art_5__para_f
GIVEN m IS A `grant month`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the month's position for the grant` m IS
    CONSIDER m's `status of the month`
    WHEN `worked` THEN m's `position of the month`
    WHEN `reserve duty` THEN m's `position of the month`
    WHEN `birth and parenting period` THEN m's `position of the month`
    OTHERWISE 0

-- 5(א): 9,600 for an employee in the reform and 6,000 for one outside it,
-- for a full position with the employer throughout the period ("the grant").
@ref akn:art_5__para_a akn:art_5__para_a/p2 akn:art_5__para_a/p3 akn:art_5__para_a/p4
GIVEN e IS AN `upper-division employee`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the full grant` e IS
    IF NOT `the agreement applies to` e THEN 0
    ELSE IF `is in the reform` e THEN 9600 ELSE 6000

`the months of the grant period` MEANS 12

-- 5(ב)-(ד): for part of the period, a part-time position, or both, the
-- share the months and the weighted position give — a position above 100%
-- included.
@ref akn:art_5__para_b akn:art_5__para_c akn:art_5__para_d
GIVEN e IS AN `upper-division employee`, months IS A LIST OF `grant month`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the one-time grant` e months IS
    `the full grant` e
    TIMES sum (map `the month's position for the grant` months)
    DIVIDED BY `the months of the grant period`

-- 5(ז): paid with October 2024's salary (paid November) and no later than
-- November 2024's (paid December) — school months 2 and 3.
@ref akn:art_5__para_g
GIVEN grant IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `agreement action`
DECIDE `the grant is paid` grant IS
    PARTY `the employer`
    MUST  `pay the one-time grant` g
          PROVIDED g AT LEAST grant
    WITHIN `month number` November
    LEST  BREACH BY `the employer` BECAUSE "תשפ\"ה/5 §5(ז): the grant is paid no later than November 2024's salary"

-- 5(ח)-(י): the grant is not salary: not for the hourly value (substitution
-- hours, an hour's absence), severance or any fund; not for the
-- minimum-wage top-up; it does not change the combined-salary base.
@ref akn:art_5__para_h akn:art_5__para_h/p2 akn:art_5__para_i akn:art_5__para_j
`how the one-time grant counts` MEANS
    `component treatment` WITH
        `is salary for every purpose`                   IS FALSE
        `counts for the hourly value`                   IS FALSE
        `counts for an hour's absence`                  IS FALSE
        `counts for severance pay`                      IS FALSE
        `counts for pension contributions`              IS FALSE
        `counts for study-fund and Dafna contributions` IS FALSE
        `counts for the minimum-wage top-up`            IS FALSE
        `is in the base of other supplements`           IS FALSE
        `counts for the jubilee grant`                  IS FALSE

-- 5(יא): where an advance was paid under the agreement of 12.9.2023, the
-- rest of it — after the part deducted on the commissioner's notice of
-- 9.4.2024 — is deducted from the salary that carries the grant.
@ref akn:art_5__para_ja
GIVEN `rest of the advance` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `agreement action`
DECIDE `the rest of the advance is deducted with the grant` `rest of the advance` IS
    PARTY `the employer`
    MUST  `deduct the rest of the advance` a
          PROVIDED a EQUALS `rest of the advance`
    WITHIN `month number` November

§§ `פרק ב' עובדי הוראה המועסקים בתנאי רפורמת עוז לתמורה`

-- §6: chapter ב applies to the employees in the reform; each rule of it
-- below asks `is in the reform`.
@ref akn:art_6
GIVEN e IS AN `upper-division employee`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `chapter ב applies to` e IF
    `is in the reform` e

-- 7(א)-(ב): from 1.9.2024 a monthly Oz 2023 shekel supplement; for a full
-- position it is the table's.
@ref akn:art_7__para_a akn:art_7__para_b akn:art_7__para_b/t1
`the table of the Oz 2023 shekel supplement` MEANS
    LIST `pulse row` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2024) 1200 0      0      0   1200,
         `pulse row` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2025) 1218 300    0      0   1518,
         `pulse row` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2026) 1236 304.50 250    0   1790.50,
         `pulse row` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2027) 1254 309    253.75 250 2066.75

GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the Oz 2023 shekel supplement for a full position on` d IS
    CONSIDER reverse (filter (GIVEN r YIELD d `is on or after` (r's `pulses from`)) `the table of the Oz 2023 shekel supplement`)
    WHEN r FOLLOWED BY rest THEN r's `pulse total`
    WHEN EMPTY THEN 0

-- 7(ג): in proportion to the position, above 100% too.
@ref akn:art_7__para_c
GIVEN e IS AN `upper-division employee`, `position fraction` IS A NUMBER, d IS A DATE
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the Oz 2023 shekel supplement` e `position fraction` d IS
    IF `chapter ב applies to` e
    THEN `the Oz 2023 shekel supplement for a full position on` d TIMES `position fraction`
    ELSE 0

-- 7(ד)-(ו) and the last paragraph: salary for every purpose — the hourly
-- value for substitution hours, an hour's absence, severance, pension
-- under §46 of the Oz agreement, the study fund and Dafna; not for the
-- minimum-wage top-up; in the base of no supplement; but counted for the
-- jubilee grant.
@ref akn:art_7__para_d akn:art_7__para_e akn:art_7__para_f akn:art_7__para_f/p2 akn:art_7__para_f/p3
`how the Oz 2023 shekel supplement counts` MEANS
    `component treatment` WITH
        `is salary for every purpose`                   IS TRUE
        `counts for the hourly value`                   IS TRUE
        `counts for an hour's absence`                  IS TRUE
        `counts for severance pay`                      IS TRUE
        `counts for pension contributions`              IS TRUE
        `counts for study-fund and Dafna contributions` IS TRUE
        `counts for the minimum-wage top-up`            IS FALSE
        `is in the base of other supplements`           IS FALSE
        `counts for the jubilee grant`                  IS TRUE

§§ `8 מבנה שבוע העבודה של מורה המועסק בתנאי הרפורמה`

-- 8, lead-in and (א)(1)-(2): from תשפ"ה, the position base of a teacher
-- on a full position is 38 weekly hours (40 → 38 in §9(ד) of the Oz
-- agreement as amended in 2014).
@ref akn:art_8/p1 akn:art_8__para_a/p1 akn:art_8__para_a__subpara_1 akn:art_8__para_a__subpara_2
`the position base in weekly hours` MEANS 38

-- (א)(3): the 38 hours are 25 frontal hours, 3 individual hours (a group
-- of up to 3 pupils, or 5 by the pedagogical team's decision; for
-- reinforcement, enrichment and dialogue) and 10 teaching-support hours in
-- the school: 2 work meetings, 2 team training, 1 parents, 5 preparation
-- and marking.
@ref akn:art_8__para_a__subpara_3 akn:art_8__para_a__subpara_3/p2 akn:art_8__para_a__subpara_3/p3 akn:art_8__para_a__subpara_3/p4 akn:art_8__para_a__subpara_3/p5 akn:art_8__para_a__subpara_3__cls_a akn:art_8__para_a__subpara_3__cls_b akn:art_8__para_a__subpara_3__cls_c akn:art_8__para_a__subpara_3__cls_d
`frontal hours` MEANS 25
`individual hours` MEANS 3
`teaching-support hours` MEANS 10
`support hours by activity` MEANS LIST 2, 2, 1, 5

GIVEN `pupils in the group` IS A NUMBER, `the pedagogical team decided on up to 5` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `an individual-hours group may have` `pupils in the group` `the pedagogical team decided on up to 5` IF
        `pupils in the group` AT MOST 3
    OR (`the pedagogical team decided on up to 5` AND `pupils in the group` AT MOST 5)

-- (ב)-(ד): a part-time teacher works by annex א's table (replacing annex
-- ג of the Oz agreement); annex ב replaces the mothers' work week and
-- annex ג the age-reduction work week. The annexes are not reproduced in
-- the circular; the hours they give are an input.
@ref akn:art_8__para_b akn:art_8__para_c akn:art_8__para_d
GIVEN `weekly hours by the agreement's annexes` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the week of a part-time, mother or age-reduced teacher` `weekly hours by the agreement's annexes` IS
    `weekly hours by the agreement's annexes`

-- (ה): for an employee above 100% in תשפ"ה, changes of position caused by
-- the move to the new work week found no claim of harm to the position
-- commitment.
@ref akn:art_8__para_e
GIVEN `position in תשפ"ה` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a change of position from the new work week founds no claim of harm` `position in תשפ"ה` IF
    `position in תשפ"ה` GREATER THAN 1

§§ `9 העסקה בתנאי הרפורמה`

-- 9(א)-(ב): from 1.9.2024, a new or existing employee below a third of a
-- position (with all employers together) is employed under the reform in
-- an upper division where he teaches 4 frontal hours or more — in that
-- upper division only.
@ref akn:art_9__para_a akn:art_9__para_a/p2 akn:art_9__para_b akn:art_9__para_b/p2
GIVEN `position with all employers` IS A NUMBER, `frontal hours in this upper division` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `is employed under the reform in this upper division despite a small position` `position with all employers` `frontal hours in this upper division` IF
    `position with all employers` LESS THAN 1 DIVIDED BY 3 AND `frontal hours in this upper division` AT LEAST 4

§§ `10 גמולי תפקיד`

DECLARE `role` IS ONE OF
    `ICT and technology coordinator`
    `skills coordinator`
    `homeroom teacher`
    `grade-level coordinator`
    `social-education coordinator`
    `social-education coordinator, social involvement`
    `pedagogical coordinator`
    `subject coordinator`
    `subject coordinator, English or mathematics`

-- akn:art_10__para_a/p1 The heading "(א) the role reward of the ICT and technology coordinator".

-- 10(א)(1): from 1.9.2024 the "ICT coordinator" is called "ICT and
-- technology coordinator" (the role above).
@ref akn:art_10__para_a__subpara_1
`the ICT coordinator is renamed from` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2024

-- The percentage role rates this agreement sets, by role and date. 10(א)(2)
-- 6% → 8% from 1.9.2025; 10(ב)(1) 6% (on the combined salary and the Oz
-- supplement); 10(ז)(1) 6% → 10% from 1.9.2024, not for the
-- social-involvement coordinator (ז(3)); 10(ח) 6% → 8% from 1.9.2025;
-- 10(יא) 8% from 1.9.2025 except English and mathematics. The rates before
-- the steps are the Oz agreement's and the 2018 agreement's, as quoted.
@ref akn:art_10__para_a__subpara_2 akn:art_10__para_b__subpara_1 akn:art_10__para_g__subpara_1 akn:art_10__para_g__subpara_3 akn:art_10__para_h/p1 akn:art_10__para_h/p2 akn:art_10__para_ja/p1 akn:art_10__para_ja/p2
GIVEN r IS A `role`, d IS A DATE, `rate before this agreement` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the role reward rate` r d `rate before this agreement` IS
    CONSIDER r
    WHEN `ICT and technology coordinator` THEN
        IF d `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2025) THEN 8% ELSE 6%
    WHEN `skills coordinator` THEN
        IF d `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2024) THEN 6% ELSE 0
    WHEN `social-education coordinator` THEN
        IF d `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2024) THEN 10% ELSE 6%
    WHEN `pedagogical coordinator` THEN
        IF d `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2025) THEN 8% ELSE 6%
    WHEN `subject coordinator` THEN
        IF d `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2025) THEN 8% ELSE `rate before this agreement`
    OTHERWISE `rate before this agreement`

-- 10(א)(3)-(4), 10(ב)(2): from 1.9.2024 the ICT and technology coordinator
-- and the skills coordinator each have one role hour in place of a frontal
-- hour of the position; the employer may give the ICT coordinator one more
-- hour or half-hour where §17(ב)(1)-(3) of the reform agreement are met.
@ref akn:art_10__para_a__subpara_3 akn:art_10__para_a__subpara_4 akn:art_10__para_b__subpara_2
GIVEN r IS A `role`, `employer adds` IS A NUMBER, `the conditions of 17(ב)(1)-(3) are met` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `role hours in place of frontal hours` r `employer adds` `the conditions of 17(ב)(1)-(3) are met` IS
    CONSIDER r
    WHEN `ICT and technology coordinator` THEN
        1 PLUS (IF `the conditions of 17(ב)(1)-(3) are met` THEN min `employer adds` 1 ELSE 0)
    WHEN `skills coordinator` THEN 1
    OTHERWISE 0

-- akn:art_10__para_a__subpara_5 A saving clause: the other rules of the ICT coordinator's reward are unchanged.
-- akn:art_10__para_b/p1 The heading "(ב) the role reward of the skills coordinator".

-- 10(ב), lead-in and (3): from 1.9.2024 the skills coordinator joins the
-- roles of §17(א) of the reform agreement, and its reward is calculated
-- and paid by the rules of the subject coordinator's.
@ref akn:art_10__para_b/p2 akn:art_10__para_b__subpara_3
GIVEN r IS A `role`
GIVETH A `role`
DECIDE `calculated and paid by the rules of` r IS
    IF r EQUALS `skills coordinator` THEN `subject coordinator` ELSE r

-- 10(ג): if the flexible matriculation programme is cancelled, 10(א)(3)
-- and 10(ב) stop applying — from the next school year if it is cancelled
-- during one.
@ref akn:art_10__para_c
GIVEN `programme cancelled in school year` IS A NUMBER, `cancelled at the start of the year` IS A BOOLEAN, `school year` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the ICT role hour and the skills coordinator still apply in` `programme cancelled in school year` `cancelled at the start of the year` `school year` IS
    IF `cancelled at the start of the year`
    THEN `school year` LESS THAN `programme cancelled in school year`
    ELSE `school year` AT MOST `programme cancelled in school year`

-- 10(ד) and 10(ו): from 1.9.2024 the homeroom teacher's reward is the
-- higher of 10% (by the existing rules) and 1,000; from 1.9.2025 the
-- grade-level coordinator's the higher of 6% and 1,100. Other rules, the
-- grade coordinator's role hours, and employees outside the reform are
-- unchanged.
@ref akn:art_10__para_d/p1 akn:art_10__para_d/p2 akn:art_10__para_d__subpara_1 akn:art_10__para_d__subpara_1/p2 akn:art_10__para_d__subpara_1/p3 akn:art_10__para_f/p1 akn:art_10__para_f/p2 akn:art_10__para_f__subpara_1 akn:art_10__para_f__subpara_1/p2 akn:art_10__para_f__subpara_1/p3
GIVEN r IS A `role`, d IS A DATE, `the percentage reward by the existing rules at the new rate` IS A NUMBER, `reward before this agreement` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the homeroom or grade-coordinator reward` r d `the percentage reward by the existing rules at the new rate` `reward before this agreement` IS
    CONSIDER r
    WHEN `homeroom teacher` THEN
        IF d `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2024)
        THEN max `the percentage reward by the existing rules at the new rate` 1000
        ELSE `reward before this agreement`
    WHEN `grade-level coordinator` THEN
        IF d `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2025)
        THEN max `the percentage reward by the existing rules at the new rate` 1100
        ELSE `reward before this agreement`
    OTHERWISE `reward before this agreement`

-- 10(ה): from 1.9.2024 the educational counsellor's reward (in the reform)
-- goes by the licence and not by seniority: 12% full rate on a temporary
-- licence, 18% on a permanent one; the full rate at 12 weekly counselling
-- hours; the other rules, the way it is calculated included, are unchanged.
@ref akn:art_10__para_e/p1 akn:art_10__para_e/p2 akn:art_10__para_e/p3 akn:art_10__para_e__subpara_a akn:art_10__para_e__subpara_b akn:art_10__para_e__subpara_b/p2 akn:art_10__para_e__subpara_b/p3 akn:art_10__para_e__subpara_b/p4
GIVEN `permanent licence` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the full counselling rate` `permanent licence` IS
    IF `permanent licence` THEN 18% ELSE 12%

`weekly counselling hours for the full rate` MEANS 12

-- akn:art_10__para_g/p1 The heading "(ז) the reward of the social-education coordinator".
-- akn:art_10__para_g__subpara_2 A saving clause: the other rules of that reward, and the rate of employees outside the reform, are unchanged.
-- akn:art_10__para_h/p3 A saving clause: the other rules of the pedagogical coordinator's reward, and the rate of employees outside the reform, are unchanged.
-- akn:art_10__para_ja/p3 A saving clause: only the subject coordinator's rate changes, and not for employees outside the reform.

-- 10(ט): from 1.9.2024 the percentage reward for preparing for the
-- 5-unit chemistry matriculation, for employees in the reform, rises from
-- 2% to 4%; its other rules are unchanged.
@ref akn:art_10__para_i/p1 akn:art_10__para_i/p2
GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the 5-unit chemistry preparation rate` d IS
    IF d `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2024) THEN 4% ELSE 2%

-- 10(י): from 1.9.2025 §14.2 of the 2018 agreement adds "system
-- coordinator" and "counselling coordinator"; in all four role holders,
-- chosen by the principal from the eight listed.
@ref akn:art_10__para_j/p1 akn:art_10__para_j/p2 akn:art_10__para_j/p3 akn:art_10__para_j/p4 akn:art_10__para_j/p5 akn:art_10__para_j/p6 akn:art_10__para_j/p7 akn:art_10__para_j/p8 akn:art_10__para_j/p9 akn:art_10__para_j/p10 akn:art_10__para_j/p11
`the list of §14.2 roles from 1.9.2025` MEANS
    LIST "trips coordinator", "pedagogical coordinator", "integration and special populations coordinator",
         "ICT and technology coordinator", "matriculation coordinator", "discipline and educational climate coordinator",
         "system coordinator", "counselling coordinator"

`role holders the principal chooses` MEANS 4

GIVEN chosen IS A LIST OF STRING
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the principal's choice is valid` chosen IF
        count chosen AT MOST `role holders the principal chooses`
    AND all (GIVEN c YIELD elem c `the list of §14.2 roles from 1.9.2025`) chosen

§§ `11 גמול חינוך מיוחד`

-- 11(א): from 1.9.2024, for an employee in the reform with a special-
-- education qualification, 9% → 10% and 14% → 15% (eligibility unchanged);
-- (ב): 17% for the hours taught in a class the Ministry defines as autism
-- or severe mental disorders, in place of 14%.
@ref akn:art_11__para_a akn:art_11__para_a/p2 akn:art_11__para_a/p3 akn:art_11__para_a/p4 akn:art_11__para_a/p5 akn:art_11__para_a/p6 akn:art_11__para_b
GIVEN `rate before the agreement` IS A NUMBER, `autism or severe mental-disorder class` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the special-education rate from 1.9.2024` `rate before the agreement` `autism or severe mental-disorder class` IS
    BRANCH IF `rate before the agreement` EQUALS 14% AND `autism or severe mental-disorder class` THEN 17%
           IF `rate before the agreement` EQUALS 14% THEN 15%
           IF `rate before the agreement` EQUALS 9% THEN 10%
           OTHERWISE `rate before the agreement`

-- akn:art_11__para_c A saving clause: the other rules of the special-education reward, and the rate of employees outside the reform, are unchanged.

§§ `12 גמול מחנך כיתת שילוב`

-- 12: agreed in principle, a reward for the homeroom teacher of a class
-- with integrated pupils entitled to a personal basket (§2 of the Second
-- Schedule to the Special Education Law) above a number to be set: not in
-- role hours, payable from 1.9.2025, its rules set between the parties by
-- 1.9.2025 and no later than 31.12.2025, within the budget of the
-- Treasury's letter of 23.9.2024. Months here count from September 2025
-- (= 1): 31.12.2025 is month 4.
@ref akn:art_12/p1 akn:art_12__para_a akn:art_12__para_b akn:art_12__para_c
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `agreement action`
DECIDE `the rules of the integration-class reward are set` IS
    (PARTY `the local authority or owning body`
     MUST  `set the rules of the integration-class reward`
     WITHIN 4
     LEST  BREACH BY `the local authority or owning body` BECAUSE "תשפ\"ה/5 §12(ג): the parties set the rules by 1.9.2025 and no later than 31.12.2025")
    RAND
    (PARTY `the teachers' union`
     MUST  `set the rules of the integration-class reward`
     WITHIN 4
     LEST  BREACH BY `the teachers' union` BECAUSE "תשפ\"ה/5 §12(ג): the parties set the rules by 1.9.2025 and no later than 31.12.2025")

`the integration-class reward is in role hours` MEANS FALSE

@ref akn:art_12__para_b
`the integration-class reward is payable from` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2025

§§ `13 גמול בגין הכנה לבגרות בעל פה בשפה האנגלית`

@ref akn:art_13/p1
GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the English oral preparation rate` d IS
    IF d `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2024) THEN 2% ELSE 0

§§ `14 גמול תפקיד בית ספרי`

-- 14(א)-(ב), (י), (יא)-(יב): from תשפ"ז, yearly, the principal may set
-- school roles in the upper division, filled with the teacher's consent,
-- and the reward units of each, by the school's priorities, the Ministry's
-- criteria and the quota of units it allots; a role and its units are set
-- afresh each year, as a rule for a full year, with no right to continue.
@ref akn:art_14__para_a akn:art_14__para_a/p2 akn:art_14__para_b akn:art_14__para_c/p12 akn:art_14__para_c/p13 akn:art_14__para_ja akn:art_14__para_ja/p2
GIVEN `school year` IS A NUMBER @desc the Hebrew school year as a number, תשפ"ז = 5787
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `school roles may be set in` `school year` IF
    `school year` AT LEAST 5787

GIVEN `the teacher consents` IS A BOOLEAN, `units within the school's yearly quota` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the principal may give a teacher a school role` `the teacher consents` `units within the school's yearly quota` IF
    `the teacher consents` AND `units within the school's yearly quota`

@ref akn:art_14__para_ja akn:art_14__para_ja/p2
GIVEN `fills the role in the month` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `is entitled to the school role reward for the month` `fills the role in the month` IF
    `fills the role in the month`

@ref akn:art_14__para_ja
`a teacher may continue in a school role after the year` MEANS FALSE

-- 14(ג): between two and five units, in whole units; (ה): each unit is
-- 200 a month (four units, 800).
@ref akn:art_14__para_c akn:art_14__para_c/p4 akn:art_14__para_c/p5
`one reward unit a month` MEANS 200

GIVEN units IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a valid number of units` units IF
    units AT LEAST 2 AND units AT MOST 5 AND units EQUALS FLOOR units

-- 14(ד): a role in §17(א) of the reform agreement or §14 of the 2018
-- agreement, or a cross-school role the Ministry requires, is not a school
-- role; the school role reward replaces no existing role reward.
@ref akn:art_14__para_c/p2 akn:art_14__para_c/p3
GIVEN `listed in 17(א) or the 2018 agreement's §14` IS A BOOLEAN, `a role every school must fill` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `may be a school role` `listed in 17(א) or the 2018 agreement's §14` `a role every school must fill` IF
    (NOT `listed in 17(א) or the 2018 agreement's §14`) AND (NOT `a role every school must fill`)

@ref akn:art_14__para_c/p3
`the school role reward replaces an existing role reward` MEANS FALSE

-- 14(ו)-(ח), (יג)-(יד): the full shekel value for a part-time teacher of a
-- third of a position or more, and no more than a full-time one's above
-- 100%; only a teacher in the reform; one school role a year; not a
-- principal or vice-principal.
@ref akn:art_14__para_c/p6 akn:art_14__para_c/p7 akn:art_14__para_c/p8 akn:art_14__para_c/p9 akn:art_14__para_c/p10 akn:art_14__para_ja/p3 akn:art_14__para_ja/p4 akn:art_14__para_ja/p5
GIVEN e IS AN `upper-division employee`, `is a vice-principal` IS A BOOLEAN, units IS A NUMBER, `position fraction` IS A NUMBER, `school roles held this year` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the school role reward` e `is a vice-principal` units `position fraction` `school roles held this year` IS
    IF     `is a teacher in the reform` e
       AND NOT `is a vice-principal`
       AND `a valid number of units` units
       AND `position fraction` AT LEAST 1 DIVIDED BY 3
       AND `school roles held this year` EQUALS 1
    THEN units TIMES `one reward unit a month`
    ELSE 0

-- 14(ט): the school role reward counts within the quota of role rewards a
-- teacher may receive; the quota is the reform agreement's, an input.
@ref akn:art_14__para_c/p11
GIVEN `role rewards held besides it` IS A NUMBER, `quota of role rewards` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the school role reward fits the quota` `role rewards held besides it` `quota of role rewards` IF
    `role rewards held besides it` PLUS 1 AT MOST `quota of role rewards`

-- 14(טו)-(טז): the principal defines each role's main tasks and publishes
-- the Ministry's criteria, the roles, their units and tasks near the start
-- of the year and before appointing; then the names appointed. "Near the
-- start of the year" names no day, so the duties carry no deadline; the
-- order is the text's.
@ref akn:art_14__para_ja/p6
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `agreement action`
DECIDE `the principal defines the school roles' tasks` IS
    PARTY `the school principal`
    MUST  `define each school role's main tasks`

@ref akn:art_14__para_ja/p7 akn:art_14__para_ja/p8
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `agreement action`
DECIDE `the principal publishes the school roles before appointing` IS
    PARTY `the school principal`
    MUST  `publish the school roles and their units`
    HENCE (PARTY `the school principal`
           MUST  `publish the names appointed to school roles`)
    LEST  BREACH BY `the school principal` BECAUSE "תשפ\"ה/5 §14(טז): the roles, units and tasks are published near the start of the year, before appointments"

-- 14(יז)-(יט): counted for the hourly value (substitution hours), absence
-- with and without pay, severance and pension under §46; not part of the
-- combined salary nor in the base of other supplements; no study fund.
@ref akn:art_14__para_ja/p9 akn:art_14__para_ja/p10 akn:art_14__para_jh akn:art_14__para_ji
`how the school role reward counts` MEANS
    `component treatment` WITH
        `is salary for every purpose`                   IS FALSE
        `counts for the hourly value`                   IS TRUE
        `counts for an hour's absence`                  IS TRUE
        `counts for severance pay`                      IS TRUE
        `counts for pension contributions`              IS TRUE
        `counts for study-fund and Dafna contributions` IS FALSE
        `counts for the minimum-wage top-up`            IS FALSE
        `is in the base of other supplements`           IS FALSE
        `counts for the jubilee grant`                  IS FALSE

§§ `15 קצובת ביגוד לפיזיותרפיסטים`

-- 15: from 1.9.2024 a physiotherapist (a teaching employee in the health
-- professions with a physiotherapy certificate who treats by it) on a full
-- position in the reform receives yearly, with July's salary, a
-- physiotherapists' clothing allowance of 800, besides §43's allowance;
-- updated as the PE teachers' (§45(ב)), with pension contributions at the
-- clothing rates (§46(ג)).
@ref akn:art_15/p1 akn:art_15/p2 akn:art_15/p3 akn:art_15/p4
GIVEN e IS AN `upper-division employee`, `is a physiotherapist` IS A BOOLEAN, `position fraction` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the physiotherapists' clothing allowance` e `is a physiotherapist` `position fraction` IS
    IF `is in the reform` e AND `is a physiotherapist` AND `position fraction` AT LEAST 1
    THEN 800
    ELSE 0

GIVEN e IS AN `upper-division employee`, `is a physiotherapist` IS A BOOLEAN, `position fraction` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `agreement action`
DECIDE `the physiotherapists' allowance is paid with July's salary` e `is a physiotherapist` `position fraction` IS
    IF `the physiotherapists' clothing allowance` e `is a physiotherapist` `position fraction` GREATER THAN 0
    THEN PARTY `the employer`
         MUST  `pay the physiotherapists' clothing allowance` a
               PROVIDED a AT LEAST `the physiotherapists' clothing allowance` e `is a physiotherapist` `position fraction`
         WITHIN `month number` July
         LEST  BREACH BY `the employer` BECAUSE "תשפ\"ה/5 §15: the physiotherapists' clothing allowance is paid with July's salary"
    ELSE FULFILLED

§§ `פרק ג' שכר מנהלים, מנהלי חטיבות עליונות וסגני מנהלים`

DECLARE `managerial post` IS ONE OF
    `principal`
    `upper-division principal`
    `vice-principal`

DECLARE `kind of manager's component` IS ONE OF
    `ordinary component`
    `homeroom reward`
    `matriculation preparation reward`
    `security coordinator reward`
    `overtime or single hours`
    `trips and out-of-school activity`
    `annual payments`
    `differential reward for school achievement`
    `national-priority incentives`
    `expense refunds`
    `tax gross-up and benefit imputation`

@desc A component of a manager's salary for 100% of a position, as section 16 sorts it.
DECLARE `manager's component` HAS
    `kind of component`   IS A `kind of manager's component`
    `component for 100%`  IS A NUMBER

-- 16: the definitions. A "principal" heads a six-, four- or three-year
-- school (grades 13-14 included) appointed by the employer's rules; an
-- "upper-division principal" is a vice-principal of a six-year school so
-- appointed under takanon §7.5.2; an "academic degree" is one recognised by
-- the Council for Higher Education or found equivalent. "Base pay" is the
-- sum, for 100%, of every salary component but those listed: for a
-- principal, not the homeroom and matriculation rewards, trips, annual
-- payments, the achievement reward, priority incentives, refunds and tax
-- gross-up; for an upper-division principal and a vice-principal also not
-- the security coordinator's reward nor overtime or single hours.
@ref akn:art_16/p1 akn:art_16/p2 akn:art_16/p3 akn:art_16/p4 akn:art_16/p5 akn:art_16/p6 akn:art_16/p7 akn:art_16/p8 akn:art_16/p9 akn:art_16/p10
GIVEN post IS A `managerial post`, k IS A `kind of manager's component`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `is in the base pay` post k IF
    CONSIDER k
    WHEN `ordinary component` THEN TRUE
    WHEN `security coordinator reward` THEN post EQUALS `principal`
    WHEN `overtime or single hours` THEN post EQUALS `principal`
    OTHERWISE FALSE

GIVEN post IS A `managerial post`, components IS A LIST OF `manager's component`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the base pay` post components IS
    sum (map (GIVEN c YIELD c's `component for 100%`)
             (filter (GIVEN c YIELD `is in the base pay` post (c's `kind of component`)) components))

-- The "minimum amount" is annex ד's, by post, number of classes and
-- management seniority; the annex is not reproduced in the circular, so it
-- is an input.
@ref akn:art_16/p11
GIVEN `annex ד's amount for the post, classes and seniority` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the minimum amount` `annex ד's amount for the post, classes and seniority` IS
    `annex ד's amount for the post, classes and seniority`


-- 17-19: from 1.9.2025, a principal (second degree, 6 classes at least),
-- an upper-division principal (first degree, 9 classes) and a
-- vice-principal (first degree, 10 classes), in Oz LaTmura, receive the
-- positive difference between the minimum amount and the base pay; none
-- where it is zero or less.
@ref akn:art_17/p1 akn:art_17__para_a akn:art_17__para_b akn:art_17__para_c akn:art_18/p1 akn:art_18__para_a akn:art_18__para_b akn:art_18__para_c akn:art_19/p1 akn:art_19__para_a akn:art_19__para_b akn:art_19__para_c
GIVEN post IS A `managerial post`, `in Oz LaTmura` IS A BOOLEAN, g IS A `degree`, classes IS A NUMBER, d IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `qualifies for the managerial supplement` post `in Oz LaTmura` g classes d IF
        d `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2025)
    AND `in Oz LaTmura`
    AND (CONSIDER post
         WHEN `principal` THEN `degree rank` g AT LEAST 2 AND classes AT LEAST 6
         WHEN `upper-division principal` THEN `degree rank` g AT LEAST 1 AND classes AT LEAST 9
         WHEN `vice-principal` THEN `degree rank` g AT LEAST 1 AND classes AT LEAST 10)

GIVEN g IS A `degree`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `degree rank` g IS
    CONSIDER g
    WHEN `no degree` THEN 0
    WHEN `first degree` THEN 1
    WHEN `second degree or higher` THEN 2

@ref akn:art_17__para_c/p2 akn:art_17__para_c/p3 akn:art_18__para_c/p2 akn:art_18__para_c/p3 akn:art_19__para_c/p2 akn:art_19__para_c/p3
GIVEN post IS A `managerial post`, `in Oz LaTmura` IS A BOOLEAN, g IS A `degree`, classes IS A NUMBER, d IS A DATE, `minimum amount` IS A NUMBER, components IS A LIST OF `manager's component`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the managerial supplement` post `in Oz LaTmura` g classes d `minimum amount` components IS
    IF `qualifies for the managerial supplement` post `in Oz LaTmura` g classes d
    THEN max 0 (`minimum amount` MINUS `the base pay` post components)
    ELSE 0

-- 20-21: the three supplements are salary for every purpose — the hourly
-- value, an hour's absence, severance, pension under §46 and the study
-- fund — and are in the base of no supplement.
@ref akn:art_20 akn:art_21
`how the managerial supplements count` MEANS
    `component treatment` WITH
        `is salary for every purpose`                   IS TRUE
        `counts for the hourly value`                   IS TRUE
        `counts for an hour's absence`                  IS TRUE
        `counts for severance pay`                      IS TRUE
        `counts for pension contributions`              IS TRUE
        `counts for study-fund and Dafna contributions` IS TRUE
        `counts for the minimum-wage top-up`            IS FALSE
        `is in the base of other supplements`           IS FALSE
        `counts for the jubilee grant`                  IS FALSE

-- 22: the managers' pay under the agreements is full reward for all their
-- managerial work whenever it is done, and the organization will raise no
-- claim on it.
@ref akn:art_22
GIVEN `work is part of the managerial role` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `is paid beyond the managerial salary` `work is part of the managerial role` IF
    NOT `work is part of the managerial role`

§§ `פרק ד' תנאי העסקה לעובדי הוראה שאינם ברפורמה`

@ref akn:art_23
GIVEN e IS AN `upper-division employee`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `chapter ד applies to` e IF
    `the agreement applies to` e AND NOT `is in the reform` e

-- 24(א)-(ג): from 1.9.2024 a shekel supplement 2023 of 500 for a full
-- position, in proportion to the position, above 100% too.
@ref akn:art_24__para_a akn:art_24__para_b akn:art_24__para_c
GIVEN e IS AN `upper-division employee`, `position fraction` IS A NUMBER, d IS A DATE
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the 2023 shekel supplement` e `position fraction` d IS
    IF `chapter ד applies to` e AND d `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2024)
    THEN 500 TIMES `position fraction`
    ELSE 0

@ref akn:art_24__para_d akn:art_24__para_d/p2 akn:art_24__para_e akn:art_24__para_f akn:art_24__para_g
`how the 2023 shekel supplement counts` MEANS
    `how the Oz 2023 shekel supplement counts`

-- 25: from 1.9.2024 the preparation reward for a state final exam in
-- grades 13-14 of technological education: 2 weekly hours for a subject
-- taught 1-5 hours, 3.5 for one taught 6 hours or more; other rules
-- unchanged.
@ref akn:art_25/p1 akn:art_25/p2 akn:art_25/p3 akn:art_25/p4 akn:art_25/p5 akn:art_25/p6
GIVEN `weekly hours the subject is taught` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the technological final-exam reward` `weekly hours the subject is taught` IS
    BRANCH IF `weekly hours the subject is taught` AT LEAST 6 THEN 3.5
           IF `weekly hours the subject is taught` AT LEAST 1 THEN 2
           OTHERWISE 0

§§ `פרק ה' כלל עובדי ההוראה`

-- 26: from 1.9.2025 each unit of the in-service training reward and of
-- the double degree rises from 1.2% to 1.3%; other rules unchanged.
@ref akn:art_26__para_a akn:art_26__para_b
GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the in-service unit rate` d IS
    IF d `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2025) THEN 1.3% ELSE 1.2%

-- 27: from 1.9.2024 a teacher who accompanies the Israeli Journey
-- programme receives, besides the trips reward, 300 a day accompanied,
-- with pension contributions of 5% (employer) and 5% (employee).
@ref akn:art_27/p1 akn:art_27/p2
GIVEN days IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the Israeli Journey grant` days IS
    300 TIMES days

GIVEN days IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the employer's pension contribution on the Israeli Journey grant` days IS
    5% TIMES `the Israeli Journey grant` days

GIVEN days IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the employee's pension deduction on the Israeli Journey grant` days IS
    5% TIMES `the Israeli Journey grant` days

-- 28: from תשפ"ו, special contracts for teaching fellows and principals
-- with an employment permit and special expertise, under the employers'
-- letter of 23.9.2024: a fellow not employed as teaching staff in the
-- three prior years (unpaid-leave years not counted); at most 6% of each
-- upper division's employment yearly, or one position where 6% is less;
-- the agreements do not apply to them; not a personal incentive contract
-- (§53); expires 31.8.2029, with a dialogue intended before then.
@ref akn:art_28__para_a akn:art_28__para_b akn:art_28__para_e akn:art_28__para_f akn:art_28__para_g akn:art_28__para_h
GIVEN `is a teaching fellow` IS A BOOLEAN, `years as teaching staff in the three before` IS A NUMBER, d IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `may be employed on a special contract` `is a teaching fellow` `years as teaching staff in the three before` d IF
        DATE_SERIAL d AT LEAST DATE_SERIAL (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2025)
    AND DATE_SERIAL d AT MOST DATE_SERIAL (DATE_FROM_DMY 31 8 2029)
    AND ((NOT `is a teaching fellow`) OR `years as teaching staff in the three before` EQUALS 0)

@ref akn:art_28__para_c
GIVEN `positions of all teaching staff in the upper division` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the special-contract ceiling` `positions of all teaching staff in the upper division` IS
    max 1 (6% TIMES `positions of all teaching staff in the upper division`)

-- 28(ד): every January the employers send the organization the scope of
-- the special contracts, principals and fellows apart (month 5).
@ref akn:art_28__para_d
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `agreement action`
DECIDE `the employers report the special contracts in January` IS
    PARTY `the local authority or owning body`
    MUST  `report the special contracts to the teachers' organization`
    WITHIN `month number` January
    LEST  BREACH BY `the local authority or owning body` BECAUSE "תשפ\"ה/5 §28(ד): the scope of the special contracts is reported every January"

-- akn:art_29__para_a The organization's undertaking to cooperate with the flexible programme; a declaration with no case for the encoding to decide.
-- akn:art_29__para_d A saving clause: cancelling the programme does not affect the rest of the agreement.

-- 29(ב): the civics performance task does not continue in the flexible
-- programme; its reward (§3(ב) of the agreement of 22.4.2009) continues
-- only for teachers who enter pupils for it outside the programme.
@ref akn:art_29__para_b
GIVEN `in the flexible programme` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the civics performance-task reward is paid` `in the flexible programme` IF
    NOT `in the flexible programme`

-- 29(ג): in the flexible programme, where the parts fall in different
-- years, the reward is paid 35% in the year of the external exam, 35% in
-- the year the tasks are submitted and 30% in the year of the school
-- assessment.
@ref akn:art_29__para_c akn:art_29__para_c/p2 akn:art_29__para_c/p3 akn:art_29__para_c/p4
GIVEN reward IS A NUMBER, `external this year` IS A BOOLEAN, `tasks this year` IS A BOOLEAN, `school assessment this year` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the flexible reward paid this year` reward `external this year` `tasks this year` `school assessment this year` IS
    reward TIMES sum (LIST (IF `external this year` THEN 35% ELSE 0),
                           (IF `tasks this year` THEN 35% ELSE 0),
                           (IF `school assessment this year` THEN 30% ELSE 0))

-- akn:art_30__para_a The organization's undertaking to cooperate with the academisation programme; a declaration with no case for the encoding to decide.

-- 30(ב): the academisation programme shall not be used to harm a teacher's
-- position, conditions or pay, nor to end employment.
@ref akn:art_30__para_b
GIVEN `the change harms the teacher's position, terms or pay` IS A BOOLEAN, `the change is made through the academisation programme` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the change is permitted` `the change harms the teacher's position, terms or pay` `the change is made through the academisation programme` IF
    NOT (`the change harms the teacher's position, terms or pay` AND `the change is made through the academisation programme`)

-- 30(ג): where some of a subject's units are done in the academisation
-- programme, the external exam's reward (about 70% of the material) is
-- divided between the units in it and outside it, in proportion to the
-- subject's total units, each in the year of its exam; the school
-- assessment's reward (about 30%) is unchanged.
@ref akn:art_30__para_c
GIVEN `external reward` IS A NUMBER, `academisation units` IS A NUMBER, `subject units` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the academisation share` `external reward` `academisation units` `subject units` IS
    `external reward` TIMES `academisation units` DIVIDED BY `subject units`

-- The first example: 2 units, 1.5 hours and 2%, one unit in the programme:
-- of the external part (1.05 hours, 1.4%), 0.525 hour and 0.7% each.
@ref akn:art_30__para_c/p2 akn:art_30__para_c/p3 akn:art_30__para_c/p4
`the first example's split` MEANS LIST 0.525, 0.7%, 0.525, 0.7%

-- The second example: 5 units, 3.5 hours and 2%, one unit in the
-- programme: of the external part (2.45 hours, 1.4%), 0.7 hour and 0.4%
-- for the programme's exam and 1.75 hours and 1% for the matriculation.
@ref akn:art_30__para_c/p5 akn:art_30__para_c/p6 akn:art_30__para_c/p7 akn:art_30__para_c/p8 akn:art_30__para_c/p9
`the second example's split` MEANS LIST 0.7, 0.4%, 1.75, 1%

-- akn:art_31 A saving clause: the flexible and academisation programmes change nothing in the existing reward for guiding and directing pupils in matriculation subjects.
-- akn:art_32 A saving clause: but for sections 29 and 30, nothing changes in the rules of the matriculation-preparation reward.

-- 33: from 1.9.2024, §14(ד), (ה), (ז) of the Oz agreement are replaced:
-- work above 100% in one school is paid by increasing the position, at the
-- hourly value of 100%, counted for the summer months, without the 28%
-- add-on; at most 12 weekly hours above the position; and employment above
-- 100% under (ו) at most 31.5%.
@ref akn:art_33/p1 akn:art_33/p2 akn:art_33/p3
`weekly hours allowed above a full position` MEANS 12
`the most employment above 100%` MEANS 31.5%
`the add-on for hours above the position during the year` MEANS 0

GIVEN `weekly hours above the position` IS A NUMBER, `employment above 100%` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `employment above 100% is within the limits` `weekly hours above the position` `employment above 100%` IF
        `weekly hours above the position` AT MOST `weekly hours allowed above a full position`
    AND `employment above 100%` AT MOST `the most employment above 100%`

-- 34: from תשפ"ו, §36 of the Oz agreement (the school-achievement grant)
-- reads "teaching employee" for "teacher" (but in its table); a principal
-- receives twice a teacher's grant and a vice-principal 1.5 times; the
-- grant goes to the staff of the eligible upper division in the year of
-- eligibility and the year before ("the qualifying period"); in full for
-- 100% through it (above 100% not counted), and pro rata for part-time or
-- part of the period (unpaid leave and sabbatical included, the
-- birth-and-parenting period counted in full); paid with August's salary;
-- one who left before payment applies within 12 months. Other rules of §36
-- unchanged.
@ref akn:art_34/p1 akn:art_34__para_a akn:art_34__para_b akn:art_34__para_c akn:art_34__para_c/p2 akn:art_34__para_f akn:art_34__para_f__subpara_d
GIVEN post IS A STRING, `teacher's grant` IS A NUMBER, `weighted position over the qualifying period` IS A NUMBER, `share of the qualifying period employed` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the school-achievement grant` post `teacher's grant` `weighted position over the qualifying period` `share of the qualifying period employed` IS
    `teacher's grant`
    TIMES (IF post EQUALS "principal" THEN 2 ELSE IF post EQUALS "vice-principal" THEN 1.5 ELSE 1)
    TIMES min `weighted position over the qualifying period` 1
    TIMES `share of the qualifying period employed`

@ref akn:art_34__para_f/p2
GIVEN grant IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `agreement action`
DECIDE `the school-achievement grant is paid in August` grant IS
    PARTY `the employer`
    MUST  `pay the school-achievement grant` g
          PROVIDED g AT LEAST grant
    WITHIN `month number` August
    LEST  BREACH BY `the employer` BECAUSE "תשפ\"ה/5 §34(ו1): the grant is paid with August's salary"

-- (ו2): an employee who left before the payment is entitled only on
-- applying within 12 months of it (months from the payment).
@ref akn:art_34__para_f/p3
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `agreement action`
DECIDE `a leaver applies for the school-achievement grant` IS
    PARTY `the teaching employee`
    MAY   `apply for the school-achievement grant`
    WITHIN 12

-- 35: from 1.9.2025 seven roles join §20(א)(1)'s table of roles earning
-- credit points, each with 2.5 points; other promotion rules unchanged.
@ref akn:art_35__para_a akn:art_35__para_a/p2 akn:art_35__para_a/p3 akn:art_35__para_a/p4 akn:art_35__para_a/p5 akn:art_35__para_a/p6 akn:art_35__para_a/p7 akn:art_35__para_a/p8 akn:art_35__para_a/p9 akn:art_35__para_b
`the roles added to the credit-point table` MEANS
    LIST "pedagogical coordinator", "integration and special populations coordinator",
         "ICT and technology coordinator", "matriculation coordinator",
         "discipline and educational climate coordinator", "counselling coordinator", "system coordinator"

GIVEN r IS A STRING, d IS A DATE
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `credit points for the role` r d IS
    IF d `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2025) AND elem r `the roles added to the credit-point table`
    THEN 2.5
    ELSE 0

§§ `מענק פרישה`

-- akn:art_35/p1 The heading "retirement grant" of sections 36-37, printed after section 35.

@desc A teacher retiring on early pension from an upper division.
DECLARE `retiree` HAS
    `in accruing pension`                      IS A BOOLEAN
    `in the year's early-pension quota`        IS A BOOLEAN
    `meets the early-pension rules`            IS A BOOLEAN
    `age at retirement`                        IS A NUMBER
    `actual teaching seniority`                IS A NUMBER
    `weighted position over the last four years` IS A NUMBER

-- 36: from תשפ"ו, yearly, up to 75 upper-division teachers in accruing
-- pension whose inclusion in the year's early-pension quota (§28(ד) of the
-- 1993 agreement, as the commissioner updated it on 4.11.2008) was
-- approved receive a retirement grant besides the early pension, if they
-- meet the early-pension rules, are under 60 and have more than 20 years.
@ref akn:art_36 akn:art_36__para_a akn:art_36__para_b akn:art_36__para_c akn:art_36__para_c/p2 akn:art_36__para_c/p3
GIVEN r IS A `retiree`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `is an eligible retiree` r IF
        r's `in accruing pension`
    AND r's `in the year's early-pension quota`
    AND r's `meets the early-pension rules`
    AND r's `age at retirement` LESS THAN 60
    AND r's `actual teaching seniority` GREATER THAN 20

`retirees the grant is given to each year` MEANS 75

-- 36 as printed limits the grant to 75 retirees a year.
GIVEN `eligible retirees this year` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `retirees paid under §36` `eligible retirees this year` IS
    min `eligible retirees this year` `retirees the grant is given to each year`

-- 37(ב)-(ד): 120,000 for a full position in the last four years; pro rata
-- to the weighted position below it; a position above 100% receives the
-- full amount and no more.
@ref akn:art_37 akn:art_37__para_b akn:art_37__para_c akn:art_37__para_d
`the retirement grant for a full position` MEANS 120000

GIVEN r IS A `retiree`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the retirement grant before any reduction` r IS
    IF `is an eligible retiree` r
    THEN `the retirement grant for a full position` TIMES min (r's `weighted position over the last four years`) 1
    ELSE 0

-- 37(ה) and the last paragraph of (ו): where more than 75 retirees in the
-- quota meet the conditions, the grant is reduced so that the total cost
-- is at most 120,000 × 75 = 9,000,000, plus what an earlier year of the
-- agreement left unused.
@ref akn:art_37__para_e akn:art_37__para_f/p3
`the yearly budget of the retirement grants` MEANS
    `the retirement grant for a full position` TIMES `retirees the grant is given to each year`

GIVEN `eligible retirees this year` IS A NUMBER, `unused from the year before` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the reduction factor` `eligible retirees this year` `unused from the year before` IS
    IF `eligible retirees this year` GREATER THAN `retirees the grant is given to each year`
    THEN min 1 ((`the yearly budget of the retirement grants` PLUS `unused from the year before`)
                DIVIDED BY (`eligible retirees this year` TIMES `the retirement grant for a full position`))
    ELSE 1

-- 37(א): paid by the employer within 30 days of the Ministry's
-- reimbursement (days).
@ref akn:art_37__para_a
GIVEN grant IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `agreement action`
DECIDE `the retirement grant is paid` grant IS
    PARTY `the employer`
    MUST  `pay the retirement grant` g
          PROVIDED g AT LEAST grant
    WITHIN 30
    LEST  BREACH BY `the employer` BECAUSE "תשפ\"ה/5 §37(א): the retirement grant is paid within 30 days of the reimbursement"

@ref akn:art_37__para_f akn:art_37__para_f/p2
`how the retirement grant counts` MEANS
    `component treatment` WITH
        `is salary for every purpose`                   IS FALSE
        `counts for the hourly value`                   IS FALSE
        `counts for an hour's absence`                  IS FALSE
        `counts for severance pay`                      IS FALSE
        `counts for pension contributions`              IS FALSE
        `counts for study-fund and Dafna contributions` IS FALSE
        `counts for the minimum-wage top-up`            IS FALSE
        `is in the base of other supplements`           IS FALSE
        `counts for the jubilee grant`                  IS FALSE

§§ `38 יום היערכות`

-- 38: a teacher who takes part in a preparation day (at most six hours)
-- before תשפ"ו or later may skip up to two individual hours in the first
-- month and up to four support hours for work meetings in the first two,
-- six in all and never more than the hours worked that day.
@ref akn:art_38__para_a akn:art_38__para_a/p2 akn:art_38__para_a/p3 akn:art_38__para_a__subpara_2 akn:art_38__para_b
GIVEN `hours worked on the preparation day` IS A NUMBER, `individual hours skipped` IS A NUMBER, `support hours skipped` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the hours skipped are allowed` `hours worked on the preparation day` `individual hours skipped` `support hours skipped` IF
        `individual hours skipped` AT MOST 2
    AND `support hours skipped` AT MOST 4
    AND `individual hours skipped` PLUS `support hours skipped` AT MOST min (min `hours worked on the preparation day` 6) 6

§§ `39 תשלום הפרשים`

@ref akn:art_39/p1
GIVEN arrears IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `agreement action`
DECIDE `the arrears are paid` arrears IS
    PARTY `the employer`
    MUST  `pay the arrears` a
          PROVIDED a AT LEAST arrears
    WITHIN `month number` November
    LEST  BREACH BY `the employer` BECAUSE "תשפ\"ה/5 §39: the arrears are paid no later than November 2024's salary"

§§ `40 פיזור יחידת עבודתו של מורה`

-- 40 (changing takanon §6.3.17): at the teacher's request, work days a
-- week by frontal hours. The bands as printed: 22-25 five days, 18-21 four,
-- 13-17 three, 12 or fewer two (F-2024-25_tashpah_05-d).
@ref akn:art_40/p1 akn:art_40/p2 akn:art_40/p3 akn:art_40/p4 akn:art_40/p5 akn:art_40/p6
GIVEN `frontal hours taught` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A LIST OF NUMBER
DECIDE `the work days the bands give for` `frontal hours taught` IS
    map (GIVEN b YIELD b's `days a week`)
        (filter (GIVEN b YIELD `frontal hours taught` AT LEAST b's `hours from` AND `frontal hours taught` AT MOST b's `hours to`)
                (LIST `days band` 22 25 5,
                      `days band` 18 21 4,
                      `days band` 13 17 3,
                      `days band` 0  12 2))

§§ `41 שינויים בלוח החופשות`

DECLARE `calendar day` IS ONE OF
    `the day after Passover`
    `the day after Shavuot`
    `the Fast of Esther`
    `a day between Yom Kippur and the eve of Sukkot`
    `another day`

-- 41: from תשפ"ה, in the Jewish sector, the day after Passover (22
-- Nisan), the day after Shavuot (7 Sivan) and the Fast of Esther are
-- school days; the days between Yom Kippur and the eve of Sukkot are
-- holidays in their place.
@ref akn:art_41/p1 akn:art_41__para_a akn:art_41__para_a__subpara_1 akn:art_41__para_a__subpara_2 akn:art_41__para_a__subpara_3 akn:art_41__para_b akn:art_41__para_b/p2
GIVEN day IS A `calendar day`, `Jewish sector` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A STRING
DECIDE `what section 41 makes the day in the upper division` day `Jewish sector` IS
    IF NOT `Jewish sector`
    THEN "unchanged by section 41"
    ELSE CONSIDER day
         WHEN `the day after Passover` THEN "a school day"
         WHEN `the day after Shavuot` THEN "a school day"
         WHEN `the Fast of Esther` THEN "a school day"
         WHEN `a day between Yom Kippur and the eve of Sukkot` THEN "a holiday"
         OTHERWISE "unchanged by section 41"

§§ `42 החזר ימי לימודים בשל שביתה`

DECLARE `sector` IS ONE OF `Jewish`, `Druze`, `Arab`

@desc A set of make-up days for the strike of 1-5.9.2024.
DECLARE `make-up days` HAS
    `for sector`              IS A `sector`
    `make-up dates`           IS A LIST OF DATE
    `for the absence on`      IS A LIST OF DATE
    `deducted with salary of` IS A NUMBER  @desc the school month whose salary bears the deduction of an advance not worked back
    `in schools`              IS A STRING  @desc which schools of the sector the set is for

-- 42.1: per the director-general's notice of 23.9.2024, five strike days
-- are made up; the two remaining are unpaid absence; September 2024's
-- salary of strikers follows the notice. Each sector's days, the
-- timetable of the weekdays missed, only those absent on those days, the
-- same number of lessons and at most the hours missed:
--   Jewish (א) Hanukkah 29-30.12.2024 for 1-2.9 (deduct January 2025);
--          (ב) Passover 6-8.4.2025 for 3-5.9 (deduct April 2025);
--   Druze  (ג) winter 22-23.12.2024 for 4-5.9 (deduct December 2024);
--          (ד) spring 15-17.4.2025, or 13-15.4.2025 in six-day schools,
--              for 1-3.9 (deduct April 2025);
--   Arab   (ה) 18-20.3 and 23-24.3.2025 (22.3 for 23.3 where Saturday is
--              a school day) for 1-5.9 (deduct April 2025).
@ref akn:art_42__para_1 akn:art_42__para_1/p2 akn:art_42__para_1/p3 akn:art_42__para_1/p4 akn:art_42__para_1__subpara_a akn:art_42__para_1__subpara_a__cls_1 akn:art_42__para_1__subpara_a__cls_2 akn:art_42__para_1__subpara_a__cls_3 akn:art_42__para_1__subpara_a__cls_3/p2 akn:art_42__para_1__subpara_b akn:art_42__para_1__subpara_b/p2 akn:art_42__para_1__subpara_b__cls_2 akn:art_42__para_1__subpara_b__cls_3 akn:art_42__para_1__subpara_b__cls_7/p2 akn:art_42__para_1__subpara_c akn:art_42__para_1__subpara_c__cls_1 akn:art_42__para_1__subpara_c__cls_2 akn:art_42__para_1__subpara_c__cls_2/p2 akn:art_42__para_1__subpara_c__cls_3 akn:art_42__para_1__subpara_d akn:art_42__para_1__subpara_d__cls_1 akn:art_42__para_1__subpara_d__cls_1/p2 akn:art_42__para_1__subpara_d__cls_2 akn:art_42__para_1__subpara_d__cls_2/p2 akn:art_42__para_1__subpara_d__cls_3 akn:art_42__para_1__subpara_d__cls_4 akn:art_42__para_1__subpara_d__cls_6/p2 akn:art_42__para_1__subpara_e akn:art_42__para_1__subpara_e__cls_1 akn:art_42__para_1__subpara_e__cls_2 akn:art_42__para_1__subpara_e__cls_3
`the make-up days` MEANS
    LIST `make-up days` `Jewish` (LIST DATE_FROM_DMY 29 12 2024, DATE_FROM_DMY 30 12 2024)
                                 (LIST DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2024, DATE_FROM_DMY 2 9 2024) 5 "every school",
         `make-up days` `Jewish` (LIST DATE_FROM_DMY 6 4 2025, DATE_FROM_DMY 7 4 2025, DATE_FROM_DMY 8 4 2025)
                                 (LIST DATE_FROM_DMY 3 9 2024, DATE_FROM_DMY 4 9 2024, DATE_FROM_DMY 5 9 2024) 8 "every school",
         `make-up days` `Druze`  (LIST DATE_FROM_DMY 22 12 2024, DATE_FROM_DMY 23 12 2024)
                                 (LIST DATE_FROM_DMY 4 9 2024, DATE_FROM_DMY 5 9 2024) 4 "every school",
         `make-up days` `Druze`  (LIST DATE_FROM_DMY 15 4 2025, DATE_FROM_DMY 16 4 2025, DATE_FROM_DMY 17 4 2025)
                                 (LIST DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2024, DATE_FROM_DMY 2 9 2024, DATE_FROM_DMY 3 9 2024) 8 "schools teaching five days",
         `make-up days` `Druze`  (LIST DATE_FROM_DMY 13 4 2025, DATE_FROM_DMY 14 4 2025, DATE_FROM_DMY 15 4 2025)
                                 (LIST DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2024, DATE_FROM_DMY 2 9 2024, DATE_FROM_DMY 3 9 2024) 8 "schools teaching six days",
         `make-up days` `Arab`   (LIST DATE_FROM_DMY 18 3 2025, DATE_FROM_DMY 19 3 2025, DATE_FROM_DMY 20 3 2025, DATE_FROM_DMY 23 3 2025, DATE_FROM_DMY 24 3 2025)
                                 (LIST DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2024, DATE_FROM_DMY 2 9 2024, DATE_FROM_DMY 3 9 2024, DATE_FROM_DMY 4 9 2024, DATE_FROM_DMY 5 9 2024) 8 "schools not teaching on Saturday",
         `make-up days` `Arab`   (LIST DATE_FROM_DMY 18 3 2025, DATE_FROM_DMY 19 3 2025, DATE_FROM_DMY 20 3 2025, DATE_FROM_DMY 22 3 2025, DATE_FROM_DMY 24 3 2025)
                                 (LIST DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2024, DATE_FROM_DMY 2 9 2024, DATE_FROM_DMY 3 9 2024, DATE_FROM_DMY 4 9 2024, DATE_FROM_DMY 5 9 2024) 8 "schools teaching on Saturday"

`strike days made up` MEANS 5

GIVEN `lessons missed` IS A NUMBER, `lessons in the make-up timetable` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `lessons to make up` `lessons missed` `lessons in the make-up timetable` IS
    min `lessons missed` `lessons in the make-up timetable`

-- The pay for the make-up lessons: an advance with September 2024's salary
-- (paid in October), one strike hour's pay for each lesson to be made up;
-- what is not made up is deducted with the salary the set names.
@ref akn:art_42__para_1__subpara_a__cls_4 akn:art_42__para_1__subpara_a__cls_4/p2 akn:art_42__para_1__subpara_a__cls_5 akn:art_42__para_1__subpara_b__cls_6 akn:art_42__para_1__subpara_b__cls_7 akn:art_42__para_1__subpara_c__cls_4 akn:art_42__para_1__subpara_c__cls_5 akn:art_42__para_1__subpara_d__cls_5 akn:art_42__para_1__subpara_d__cls_6 akn:art_42__para_1__subpara_e__cls_4 akn:art_42__para_1__subpara_e__cls_5
GIVEN `lessons to make up` IS A NUMBER, `pay for a strike hour` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the make-up advance` `lessons to make up` `pay for a strike hour` IS
    `lessons to make up` TIMES `pay for a strike hour`

GIVEN s IS A `make-up days`, `lessons not made up` IS A NUMBER, `pay for a strike hour` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `agreement action`
DECIDE `an advance not worked back is deducted` s `lessons not made up` `pay for a strike hour` IS
    IF `lessons not made up` GREATER THAN 0
    THEN PARTY `the employer`
         MUST  `deduct an uncompleted strike advance` a
               PROVIDED a EQUALS `lessons not made up` TIMES `pay for a strike hour`
         WITHIN s's `deducted with salary of`
         LEST  BREACH BY `the employer` BECAUSE "תשפ\"ה/5 §42: the advance for lessons not made up is deducted with the salary the section names"
    ELSE FULFILLED

-- 42.2: an employee on birth and parenting leave, reserve duty or sick on
-- the make-up days returns the strike hours in substitution hours and free
-- days within the two months after returning to work.
@ref akn:art_42__para_2
`months to return the hours after coming back` MEANS 2

-- 42.3: besides the five days, an employee who struck on 6-8.9.2024 has
-- the scheduled hours of those days deducted, with October 2024's salary
-- and at the latest November 2024's — and in any case when the one-time
-- grant is paid, which the clause calls "section 7 of the agreement of
-- 23.9.2024" (F-2024-25_tashpah_05-c).
@ref akn:art_42__para_3 akn:art_42__para_3/p2
GIVEN `scheduled hours on 6-8.9.2024` IS A NUMBER, `hourly value` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `agreement action`
DECIDE `the unpaid strike days are deducted` `scheduled hours on 6-8.9.2024` `hourly value` IS
    PARTY `the employer`
    MUST  `reduce the salary for the unpaid strike days` a
          PROVIDED a EQUALS `scheduled hours on 6-8.9.2024` TIMES `hourly value`
    WITHIN `month number` November
    LEST  BREACH BY `the employer` BECAUSE "תשפ\"ה/5 §42.3: the hours of 6-8.9.2024 are deducted no later than November 2024's salary"

-- 43: on signature the organization announces at once to all secondary
-- teaching staff the end of every organizational measure (trips, grades
-- included) and instructs them to report grades, issue certificates and
-- take part in out-of-school activities.
@ref akn:art_43
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `agreement action`
DECIDE `the organization announces the end of the measures` IS
    (PARTY `the teachers' union`
     MUST  `announce the end of the organizational measures`
     WITHIN 1
     LEST  BREACH BY `the teachers' union` BECAUSE "תשפ\"ה/5 §43: the end of the organizational measures is announced at once")
    RAND
    (PARTY `the teachers' union`
     MUST  `instruct the staff to report grades, issue certificates and join out-of-school activities`
     WITHIN 1
     LEST  BREACH BY `the teachers' union` BECAUSE "תשפ\"ה/5 §43: the staff are told to report the withheld grades without delay, issue certificates and take part in out-of-school activities")

-- 44: per the commissioner's instruction of 23.9.24 and circular תשפ"ד/8:
-- (1) the deduction of the advance from salaries stops — none in September
-- 2024's salary; (2) the rest of the advance (the two remaining parts) is
-- deducted with the salary that pays the one-time grant, which the clause
-- places in "section 7(יא) of the collective agreement"
-- (F-2024-25_tashpah_05-c).
@ref akn:art_44 akn:art_44__para_1 akn:art_44__para_2/p1
GIVEN `school month` IS A NUMBER, `month the one-time grant is paid` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the rest of the advance is deducted in` `school month` `month the one-time grant is paid` IF
        (NOT `school month` EQUALS `month number` September)
    AND `school month` EQUALS `month the one-time grant is paid`

-- akn:art_44__para_2/p2 akn:art_44__para_2/p3 akn:art_44__para_2/p4 akn:art_44__para_2/p5 akn:art_44__para_2/p6 akn:art_44__para_2/p7 akn:art_44__para_2/p8 akn:art_44__para_2/p9 akn:art_44__para_2/p10 akn:art_44__para_2/p11 akn:art_44__para_2/p12 akn:art_44__para_2/p13 akn:art_44__para_2/p14 akn:art_44__para_2/p15 akn:art_44__para_2/p16 akn:art_44__para_2/p17 akn:art_44__para_2/p18 akn:art_44__para_2/p19 akn:art_44__para_2/p20 akn:art_44__para_2/p21 akn:art_44__para_2/p22 akn:art_44__para_2/p23 akn:art_44__para_2/p24 akn:art_44__para_2/p25 akn:art_44__para_2/p26 akn:art_44__para_2/p27 akn:art_44__para_2/p28 akn:art_44__para_2/p29 akn:art_44__para_2/p30 akn:art_44__para_2/p31 akn:art_44__para_2/p32 akn:art_44__para_2/p33 akn:art_44__para_2/p34 akn:art_44__para_2/p35 The contact telephones, the sign-off, signatures and the list of copies, which the corpus prints inside §44; no rule.

§§ `Worked examples`

-- Examples and checks.

`a teacher in the reform` MEANS
    `upper-division employee` WITH
        `represented by the teachers' organization` IS TRUE
        `covered by the Oz LaTmura agreement`        IS TRUE
        `employed under Oz LaTmura terms`            IS TRUE
        `is a principal`                             IS FALSE

`a teacher outside the reform` MEANS
    `upper-division employee` WITH
        `represented by the teachers' organization` IS TRUE
        `covered by the Oz LaTmura agreement`        IS TRUE
        `employed under Oz LaTmura terms`            IS FALSE
        `is a principal`                             IS FALSE

GIVEN n IS A NUMBER, s IS A `grant month status`, p IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A LIST OF `grant month`
DECIDE `months of` n s p IS
    IF n AT MOST 0
    THEN EMPTY
    ELSE `grant month` s p FOLLOWED BY `months of` (n MINUS 1) s p

