#ASSERT `the one-time grant` `a teacher outside the reform` (`months of` 12 `worked` 1) EQUALS 6000
#ASSERT `the one-time grant` `a teacher in the reform` (`months of` 12 `worked` 1.1) EQUALS 10560
#ASSERT `the one-time grant` `a teacher in the reform` (append (`months of` 6 `worked` 1) (`months of` 6 `unpaid leave or sabbatical` 1)) EQUALS 4800

