-- F-2024-25_tashpah_05-a: §36 pays at most 75 retirees a year; §37(ה)
-- spreads the budget over more than 75 by reducing each grant. For 100
-- eligible retirees on full positions, §36 pays 75 the full 120,000 and
-- 25 nothing; §37(ה) pays all 100 90,000.
`§36 and §37(ה) disagree on a year of 100 eligible retirees` MEANS
        `retirees paid under §36` 100 EQUALS 75
    AND `the reduction factor` 100 0 TIMES `the retirement grant for a full position` EQUALS 90000
#ASSERT `§36 and §37(ה) disagree on a year of 100 eligible retirees`

-- F-2024-25_tashpah_05-b: the second example of 30(ג) gives the
-- programme's unit 0.7 hour and 0.4%; the rule gives it 2.45 × 1/5 = 0.49
-- hour and 1.4% × 1/5 = 0.28%.
`the second academisation example departs from the rule` MEANS
        NOT `the academisation share` 2.45 1 5 EQUALS 0.7
    AND NOT `the academisation share` (1.4%) 1 5 EQUALS 0.4%
#ASSERT `the second academisation example departs from the rule`

-- F-2024-25_tashpah_05-c: in this text the one-time grant and its advance
-- deduction are §5 and §5(יא); §7 is the Oz 2023 shekel supplement and has
-- no subsection (יא).
`the grant's section in this text` MEANS 5
`the section §42.3 and §44 name for the grant` MEANS 7
`§42.3 and §44 cite a section that is not the grant's` MEANS
    NOT `the section §42.3 and §44 name for the grant` EQUALS `the grant's section in this text`
#ASSERT `§42.3 and §44 cite a section that is not the grant's`

-- F-2024-25_tashpah_05-d: §40's bands give no row for a teacher with more
-- than 25 frontal hours, whom §33 allows (up to 12 weekly hours beyond a
-- full position), nor for one with 21.5.
`§40 has no row above 25 frontal hours` MEANS
        `the work days the bands give for` 27 EQUALS EMPTY
    AND `the work days the bands give for` 21.5 EQUALS EMPTY
#ASSERT `§40 has no row above 25 frontal hours`

